  "question": {
    "text": "The normal to the parabola <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>y</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow> </math> at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math> meets the parabola again at the point"
